{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16212410","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16212410","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1621241001:1":{"text":"我很少见到小蓝会主动接近陌生人……难道……","source_cn":"我很少见到小蓝会主动接近陌生人……难道……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC63B9B4FC0881D97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621241002:1":{"text":"你多心了，我遇到它纯属偶然，并不是协会的引导技艺。","source_cn":"你多心了，我遇到它纯属偶然，并不是协会的引导技艺。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB85D1671847D0BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621241003:1":{"text":"我在文献中读到过，神话蓝鳍豚不是普通的动物，非常聪明，懂得人心，也能感应魔法。","source_cn":"我在文献中读到过，神话蓝鳍豚不是普通的动物，非常聪明，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD509FD133F74B0E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621241004:1":{"text":"那些怀着恶意的人根本靠近不了它，这也是偷猎者们至今都抓不到它的原因。","source_cn":"那些怀着恶意的人根本靠近不了它，这也是偷猎者们至今都抓...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2703C29E2FDF8A70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621241005:1":{"text":"所以你一开始就知道小蓝的存在？","source_cn":"所以你一开始就知道小蓝的存在？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE03534DE220116B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","documen